{#
  module/Schoenstatt/view/schoenstatt/schoenstatt/index.phtml, ported.

  The contact search bar, then two panels over the shared assignments table.

  **`header_text` is markup and is passed through unescaped**, exactly as the .phtml
  does: the partial documents it as "MUST be pre-escaped" and echoes `$this->headerText`
  raw, because the first heading is an `<a>`. So the two `|raw` filters here are the
  original's contract rather than a shortcut — and the reason the association name is
  escaped explicitly before being wrapped in the link.

  The two headings differ in a way that looks like a mistake and is the original: the
  first translates the association's name, the second passes the literal string
  'National movements' with no translate() call at all, so it stays English in every
  locale. See App\Controller\MovementController.
#}
{% extends 'layout.html.twig' %}

{% block content %}
{% include 'schoenstatt/_contact-search-bar.html.twig' with {
    'form': form,
    'center_on_page': false,
} only %}
{#
  The first heading's href is **not** escaped and its name is, which is what the .phtml
  does: it concatenates `$this->url(...)` straight into the attribute and wraps only the
  name in `translate()`. Escaping the URL is the tidier-looking option and renders
  `&#x2F;` for every slash — a visible difference from the laminas page.
#}
{% include 'schoenstatt/_assignments-table.html.twig' with {
    'assignments': presidium.assignments,
    'wrap_in_panel': true,
    'show_active': true,
    'show_inactive': false,
    'header_text': '<a href="' ~ presidium_href ~ '">' ~ translate(presidium.name)|e ~ '</a>',
    'columns': ['role', 'person', 'email', 'telephone'],
} only %}
{% include 'schoenstatt/_assignments-table.html.twig' with {
    'assignments': national_leaders,
    'wrap_in_panel': true,
    'show_active': true,
    'show_inactive': false,
    'header_text': 'National movements',
    'columns': ['association', 'person', 'email', 'telephone'],
    'association_format_options': {'showLabel': false},
} only %}
{% endblock %}
